47
00:01:33,918 --> 00:01:36,217
tiny slice of America's five hundred biggest

48
00:01:36,118 --> 00:01:36,658
companies.

49
00:01:37,468 --> 00:01:39,247
When those companies make money, a little

50
00:01:39,148 --> 00:01:40,728
