55
00:01:48,441 --> 00:01:49,561
That's it? A stick?

56
00:01:50,145 --> 00:01:51,905
Just wait. Trees take time.

57
00:01:52,397 --> 00:01:55,196
Grandpa winks. Nickel yawns. And thirty years

58
00:01:55,097 --> 00:01:55,836
