89
00:03:04,409 --> 00:03:07,149
March 2009. Rosie has had her tree

90
00:03:07,049 --> 00:03:09,529
for twelve years. It's worth $1,103.

91
00:03:10,977 --> 00:03:13,337
That's just $103 more than Ben's cookie

92
00:03:13,237 --> 00:03:13,656
