96
00:03:22,191 --> 00:03:23,271
Rosie picks up the axe.

97
00:03:23,896 --> 00:03:26,036
Then the phone rings. It's Grandpa.

98
00:03:26,685 --> 00:03:29,325
Rosie. Storms end. But a tree you

99
00:03:29,225 --> 00:03:30,725
chop down never grows back.

100
00:03:31,241 --> 00:03:33,601
So, does she chop it? Stay with

101
00:03:33,501 --> 00:03:35,541
me, because the answer is worth thousands

102
00:03:35,441 --> 00:03:36,241
of dollars.

103
00:03:36,946 --> 00:03:38,546
And if you like money stories like

104
00:03:38,446 --> 00:03:40,706
this one, hit subscribe, so you don't

105
00:03:40,606 --> 00:03:41,386
